y.</span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:98.611%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:32.702%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.463%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.463%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.463%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.463%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.463%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:9.468%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="15" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:114%">Three Months Ended June 30,</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="15" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:114%">Six Months Ended June 30,</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="33" style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;